{{/*
login-gate.gohtml — the "you must sign in" notice rendered in place of a page
body.

Shown only when the app HAS an auth system (.UI.ShowAuth) AND the caller is not
signed in. Orb sets ShowAuth:false (internal/orbserver/ui_handlers.go), so orb
never gates and one page template can serve both apps — which is what lets
shared/pages/*.gohtml exist at all. Gating on .IsAuthn alone would make every
orb page render the gate, since orb has no session to set it.
*/}}
{{define "login-gate.gohtml"}}
<div class="notification is-warning is-light">
  <a class="js-modal-trigger" data-target="login-modal">Login</a> to view this page.
</div>
{{end}}
